{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9MiMUxvsc4mkh0ynXwP3LA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:11.323822+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9MiMUxvsc4mkh0ynXwP3LA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8WAFIv1u3fy8GfcQTiaG3kZD5HanKxCsZC85GXs9Sc9PyH4jP87y7dQicnPQT8vk9pkKFulmib5RxAYVFyRVEfGtROSH1Jl42RhOM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8UTBcaG42m7ZSWX8QCojx7BoHakWKibpdYzcT23boicGvAtdrlVFQjc9HIfvDsmnfI36SUeVIKChyeEcBHQFHM0uHe1G01nUH5oc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8Vvfnicc9nicugpBaibeLXZHbZhria1JUlbsGTN8H4qm1JhdOuQwXnDW3rJx1MVe0zulGyWr68HrDdIBvVaIXF9gNhYsXHnjKO3GYo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8XrZ4qPTlRDTYWgutRAHlM7whnGf7Sib4akDuZPtjUGHa2lceq0l8bx5icjH9ZZFWCZAtxPjhxqQEM80Vgg1qB9tOeLmEa1E2vHQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8XUoibceGQFnHN62ytEwbSxstk0fwUfqyMxeERzUtczVFiaiaoGLKfHIkkPA1xvBfODP1nGAvx6DX5hJg9hFq4vjdB4YgiaWPVbdno/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8VUftA4b6B5uY1SpiaCY802RcicDB24vH7Xbf3SGJVoJjVWH4G9TzjG8oqR5Y9OibI8ib6WlCLRSbiaMghSpHN5emSodicF7zhfhkW3E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8VKdlZ26SrCiaQ99YEHhaD0YiaPGGCGlyFC1YL68HpaVfBzgXm8IvMezcJM86fy87gDxuGLYxibU4JA9T4Asiaj67bianqGcznsQlu8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>西安外国语大学英文学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>关于接收2027年</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>推荐免试硕士研究生</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>预申请的通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>西安外国语大学英文学院2027年招收推荐免试硕士研究生（以下简称“推免生”）工作即将开始，有望获得所在本科院校推荐资格且有意申请推荐免试攻读西安外国语大学英文学院硕士研究生的人员，请登录下列网址申请：“https://stuxisu.molstone.cn/”。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8XGINc7l4vLyrT1hic2LchKSmkib9chiarrticWrsknS5Ut0H1tTao7VDcS5vVtaMr3GHFPxqwjGp9CjAPJrTH1WVic0cDCcoqjEpmY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8WkNP9oaHxl3ad9y9zXWkwOf7u00qicMPqd5tViarLD1SBzZHwKzaUnALXF0XM53lPibAXDWBvZUCx6Aibhqyez1LKfjuz7P8lI3D8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>英文学院前身为英语系，1958年开始招收英语专业本科生，1979年开始培养硕士研究生。2002年更名为英文学院。2014年开始培养英语语言文学博士研究生，2015年开始招收博士后研究人员。学院拥有外国语言文学博士一级学科学位授权点和硕士一级学科学位授权点，下设英语语言文学、外国语言学及应用语言学、翻译学3个二级学科学术型学位硕士点，形成了本科、硕士、博士完整的培养体系。</span></p><p><span>学院师资力量雄厚，在编教师171人，专任教师149人，近95%的专任教师有海外留学背景；教授和副教授88人，博士（含在读）72人；博士生导师16人，硕士生导师74人。学院现有省级人才计划入选专家6人，陕西省教学名师2人。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8VZ4fWhRgib7RSGhwnrYHlEczl5IoJMe2lzR6yzAfiaf7smBUjYkiaLupPicekj5tjOACQateTXnbticL8b3SnchaelYbcJAPMZ5KjY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8WKiaHmZWIkO21qPjA17Cb8FRrV50icL3CNw2QGH49cOvblMO0OrzING8mPl4TSickCtGKJomPXtvPBEjSdgKiceWGn2aPpHbVTMVU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德优良，遵纪守法，身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></p><p><span>2.全国院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，学习成绩优秀，研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识和创新能力；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></p><p><span>4.2027年入学前获得本科毕业证书及学位证书。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8U21bF4wSovib8tbeDrLU2rhQn1nOtjK2WvxoSvhVFiaibT6icealCy6M0MKHgeqBZXD6ZGmMFhVSGqfOcx6HEglia0mlSOYFSSrTLk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、接受推免申请专业</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8UgY86fPwNLdpwlwcFWJ2T6avplIkSUTrQENCKnLYyA2cWcmOOsjxUl4jgvgucDEiaGa28bCNAQAfSXFQ4E7nEG0qyjsCSBL6vY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>根据《西安外国语大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预申请公告》（详见链接https://yzw.xisu.edu.cn/info/1093/4722.htm），我院确定以下专业接收推免生：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8XwUq2wyDDXyW7mabgckMxOuA6N1Sw4lj280CibnlUNSnj1GkRLssbwPEnsMpmWP9vpA3ibmMVE3dQYD0eID2uQyOwfT7vqCa5tI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>英语语言文学下设4个研究方向：</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8XfNFtBqjZGfhsMb7oeGuC2iacBRJDVcWdMNjZLiacW5Fk5p6Hwu52cNvuSHXTDbJEqPg7yhHtmBthSicq7oFr7ic66GmThsahibJjY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）英语文学</span></p><p><span>（二）文艺理论与批评</span></p><p><span>（三）比较文学（中英）</span></p><p><span>（四）区域国别与跨文化</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>外国语言学及</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>应用语言学</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>下设5个研究方向：</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8UtJZvlEIwmRnZDF1gswVnpo5yVkfvk8DlF4iaZxj8UvTP2FNwRgZFOQ1kwEjJW5abg2mGBN6a53ZWGkUptdm9ohwcekF3l0Gew/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>（一）生成语言学</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）功能语言学与认知语言学</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）语言智能科学与技术</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）外语教育教学</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）商务英语</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>翻译学下设3个研究方向：</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8UrmSANibvuCaju2IFPK2B3OibFdticgOuiaDG9Y60gwh8BOT32vBnG8eOaPu0Bpkxliaiaib2YzjZIHEz4iaLlySU8FgiatZoehxvLFcUQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）翻译理论与实践</span></p><p><span>（二）文学翻译</span></p><p><span>（三）翻译史</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8X8p5wYicJ72CjGw7QZhvsPgZrfnGP2Y31NrrTt7xibQVT70hTAwcrokQMOicNw5QlRkBuvJhibmFibX3mLhMoB1cnaN0b8PvIWgneo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、申请方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8Uzrllw7jicO7nnqIoiaFWNraBJQnb8gahAzGC7qS6iaMWP9a4D7of6CnXRkCfhNnicVibbkeNSricbDSSsibEgLmSjHyBiad4hZafHvNg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>（一）申请时间</span></p><p><span>9月7日—9月17日</span></p><p><span>（二）申请方式</span></p><p><span>申请人登录下列网址进行申请：https://stuxisu.molstone.cn/</span></p><p><span>注意事项：</span></p><p><span>1.申请人完成注册后，身份证号即为登录账号；</span></p><p><span>2.登录后点击推免管理－推免生申请填报信息进行相关信息填写；</span></p><p><span>3.申请人需将所有证明材料汇总成一个PDF文件后进行上传。</span></p><p><span>学院将根据上级政策开展考核选拔工作，请有意向申请我院2027年推免研究生的同学加入QQ群：英文学院2027年推免咨询群（群号1107912542），并将群昵称改为:报考专业+姓名+本科学校。其他后续工作安排将在群中通知。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8UiarlqUapDwTicUtrHDAecUEnFRKia02E2lK0BgiaXVA8zc5WKL1jWemFiacGF6hvIU8ib0OYsgcG4iaFkicdGzsnDcBpoxo9fk8RESdo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>（三）复试安排</span></p><p><span>1. 学院通知复试</span></p><p><span>学院对推免生的报名信息进行初审，确定复试名单，向申请人发放复试通知。请申请人关注英文学院的官网（https://ses.xisu.edu.cn/）并保证电话畅通。</span></p><p><span>2. 申请人参加复试，学院确定拟录取名单。申请人复试时需提供的材料：</span></p><p><span><span>（1）学生证、身份证原件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）加盖学校教务部门公章的成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）其他有关材料（如专业外语等级证书、大学英语四六级考试成绩单、获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）经本人签字确认的诚信承诺书（见https://yzw.xisu.edu.cn/info/1093/4722.htm网页上的附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料。</span></span></p><p><span>（四）推免服务系统</span></p><p><span>待全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（以下简称“推免服务系统”）开通后，被拟录取的推免生需登录“推免服务系统”进行注册，并按照拟接收的专业填报相关志愿。我校将在“推免服务系统”中发放复试及拟录取通知。未按拟接收专业填报志愿者及未在规定时间内按要求完成录取确认者，均视为自动放弃。</span></p><p><span>（五）未进行先期申请的请在“推免服务系统”开通后进行报名。学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以学院的通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8Vz6FvR2w2rlf9LfMicjnOI9LrZCFzXicNG7Y5QvhLJvFDnhWLRia4MRSiaP7ibj7nTCdlz6k7ztIpUrEsZDF2vXxs3Emb4bz5JsW98/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、学费</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8UsVeNg60SfQJPErtHuicHlTCc4Gj04NQ8DPibEdcMCJ84CIdayBSxnI3kckiaPo26ib67SzUPItGO14Ohodd20icjsOtVMYicctZ4FM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>所有研究生按照国家规定缴纳学费。具体学费标准以学校当年公布的收费标准为准。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8XicneTAHR1jabeYz3EMWsbDIWpbhO9xWpt08sU04opbWxtuKTSQmayuFaDftTvQgQLjDxbsfK3r63U5TeibUnHzPfOSYjsp7H0k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、奖助学金</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8XmIcV8hPSjicr2dWmT5mLHy5hP8gcCrsM7OO5SmMCeVQpgU6wUoSUeTG2PIF5btiaFaW30WaeRSPnp7djudib60xs32qI8D5npDM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>1.硕士研究生国家奖学金：20000元/生·年；</span></p><p><span>2.硕士研究生国家助学金：6000元/生·年；</span></p><p><span>我校还设有学业奖学金、困难补助、三助岗位等奖助体系，为研究生顺利完成学业创造良好的学习和生活条件。奖助学金政策以当年通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8UPvQQO8AzTLdV7JLGAMPueswesjXdatE2WQtlqGZ1rLnNX513we13icBtQGVpaWee61TEaLNjRc1UB7LWmdynoSicRka3lukKkM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>七、其他事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/vaWeWibqlM8WXqbictEicDhYq09cI0e8LdYKOrKIFR5zA79b7xa8XialfVibg5L1icY9ic3coS6cROVbOdYNWXIqWEhicc7iay7z4Q83clgTuCmo5R24/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>（一）有以下情形之一的，取消录取资格：</span></p><p><span>1.在推荐免试过程中弄虚作假的；</span></p><p><span>2.硕士研究生入学前未取得学士学位或本科毕业证书，或受处分的；</span></p><p><span>3.体检不合格的；</span></p><p><span>4.拟录取后至本科毕业前发生严重违法违规违纪行为的。</span></p><p><span>（二）已被我校接收的推免生，不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vaWeWibqlM8VcRvFdboYia5cSFuprIeGppzAWwgicwQrnmGdES4I53cLu84hcOX8aeicLlg7C8